\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Everything must work with the network off at demo time except for the Nango sync and the Respan-routed Lambda call for stage 5 \'97 venue wifi is a named risk. Pre-index before demos.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The model must return strict JSON. Use constrained/schema-forced decoding if the serving stack supports it; otherwise a strict parser that retries once and drops the record on a second failure. One bad response must never stall the batch.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 This is a two-person, ~5.5-hour build. Bias toward the smallest thing that works over the more "correct" thing. If you're about to add infrastructure (a queue, a second database, a config system) that isn't in this spec, say so and ask before adding it.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
